# Web / frontend craft

- Follow `docs/design-system.md` and existing classes in `web/app/globals.css`.
- Prefer editing existing components/classes over new design systems.
- Marketing: flat editorial, section rhythm via `.section-spacing` / `.section-bg-alt`.
- Product shell: `--shell-inset`, `.form-card`, `.data-table-wrap`, `.dashboard-empty`.
- Amounts/dates use `.mono-data`. Interactive radius defaults to 6px in product chrome.
- Avoid glow stacks, multi-layer shadows, purple accents, and emoji decoration.
- Parent KTI orange is `--brand` / `text-brand` - stamps and marks only; keep `--accent` for primary CTAs and nav.
- Read `web/AGENTS.md` / Next docs under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before novel Next APIs.
